## Ω (omega: purpose)
context-mesh := MCP server → cross-surface AI context sync
¬context-blindness ∀ AI surfaces → coherent identity + state

## Σ (sigma: state)
```
EXISTS := {
  src/types/index.ts (all types),
  src/lib/direction.ts (policy engine + hard block),
  src/lib/core-encoder.ts (.core encode/decode/coremin),
  src/lib/ship-ape.ts (local file store, data/packages/),
  src/lib/seed-loader.ts (loads .core files on seed),
  src/tools/pull.ts (context_pull: direction-filtered merge),
  src/tools/push.ts (context_push: policy-gated writes),
  src/tools/distill.ts (context_distill: Claude API → .core),
  src/tools/sync.ts (context_sync: TTL expiry + reports),
  src/tools/set-policy.ts (context_set_policy: persistent overrides),
  src/index.ts (MCP server, 8 tools, --seed/--sync CLI modes),
  context-packages/ (brian-personal.core, brian-shared.core, this file),
  context-mesh-scheduler/ (separate repo, StdioClientTransport wired),
  docs/ (ONESHEET, USER_GUIDE, ARCHITECTURE_DIAGRAM, PRESS_RELEASE)
}
NEEDED := {
  Phase 5: PM Hub system prompt injection integration,
  Ship APE sync layer (optional Phase 2+ enhancement),
  Claude Desktop config tested in prod,
  context_list guard for _reports/_policies dirs
}
```

## Φ (phi: patterns)
```
architecture := local_first → no external deps for storage
storage := data/packages/{namespace}/{id}.json
key_decision := Ship_APE_MCP_tools ¬→ machine_readable (truncates at 77-100 chars)
  → local file store chosen for Phase 1
hard_block := work ¬→ personal_surfaces (code-level, ¬overridable)
edge_bird_fix := was classified 'custom' → now 'personal' (hard-coded in getSurfaceOwnerGroup)
distill_model := claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 (configurable via DISTILL_MODEL env)
scheduler := StdioClientTransport → spawns context-mesh as subprocess
```

## Ρ (rho: roadmap)
```
done:     Phase 1 (core MCP), Phase 2 (policy persist), Phase 3 (distill), Phase 4 (scheduler)
next:     Phase 5 (PM Hub injection), Claude Desktop prod wiring
horizon:  Ship APE sync layer, multi-user support, web UI for package management
```

## Λ (lambda: architecture)
```
surfaces → context-mesh MCP (stdio) → DirectionEngine → LocalFileStore
scheduler → StdioClientTransport → context-mesh MCP → context_sync + context_distill
.core format: Ω Σ μ Ρ Φ χ Λ Γ ε ν τ Π Δ Ψ κ sections
namespace_groups: personal={personal-claude, edge-bird, day-one}, work={work-claude, pm-hub}, custom=*
```

