Q1: storage backend? A: local files (data/packages/), ¬Ship APE MCP tools
Q2: hard block surfaces? A: personal-claude, edge-bird, day-one (work ¬→ all three)
Q3: distill model? A: claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 (env: DISTILL_MODEL)
Q4: scheduler transport? A: StdioClientTransport (spawns context-mesh as subprocess)
Q5: phases complete? A: 1-4 done, Phase 5 (PM Hub) pending
Q6: edge-bird fix? A: was 'custom' group → fixed to 'personal' in getSurfaceOwnerGroup
```

